# Claude Code writes runtime state into ~/.claude (sessions, projects, history,
# .claude.json, plugins, caches…). When this package is stow-FOLDED (i.e. ~/.claude
# is a whole-dir symlink into here, which happens when ~/.claude didn't exist at
# install time), all that runtime lands in the dotfiles tree and shows as untracked.
# Ignore everything, then re-include only the config we actually version.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/settings.json
!/hooks/
